{"sections":[{"slug":"本质代数理论","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"本质代数理论"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">本质代数理论</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"本质代数理论"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">本质代数理论是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数理论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的推广</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可视为通过</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">部分定义函数</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/语法–语义对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">语法</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对有限极限范畴的一种</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/数学对象的表现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">表现</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">通过语法</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">本质代数理论</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">作为一种</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/一阶语言","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">一阶理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数理论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的推广</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其函数允许部分定义</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即定义在由等式给出的子集上</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">通过语法范畴</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一个</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">本质代数理论</span></strong> (<span lang=\"zh\">或者更准确地说是该理论的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/语法范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">语法范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"), <span lang=\"zh\">就是一个具有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/有限极限","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">有限极限</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span> $\\mathcal T$. <span lang=\"zh\">因此本质代数理论又叫</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">有限极限理论</span></strong> (finite limit theory).</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">本质代数理论</span> $\\mathcal T$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span> <strong><span lang=\"zh\">模型</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">为保持有限极限的函子</span> $\\mathcal T\\to\\mathcal C$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>(<span lang=\"zh\">小</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">范畴的理论是一种本质代数理论</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">例如</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">态射的复合只能对首尾相连的态射定义</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}